{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quaver</strong> is a community-driven and open-source competitive rhythm game with two game modes and online leaderboards. Create your own maps, or challenge the world in online multiplayer matches. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fully-featured 4 and 7 key vertically scrolling rhythm game client complete with a sleek and minimalistic user interface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/980610/extras/9ca685640a8a86beb21d7b0ce91b8319.poster.avif?t=1728170196\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/980610/extras/9ca685640a8a86beb21d7b0ce91b8319.webm?t=1728170196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/980610/extras/9ca685640a8a86beb21d7b0ce91b8319.mp4?t=1728170196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes:</strong> Play the game with 4 keys or challenge yourself with 7. Each game mode has separate global and country leaderboards to compete on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Challenge up to 16 players in online multiplayer battles with a large focus on competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fully-Featured Map Editor:</strong> Create your own maps to any of your favorite songs. Upload and share them with the world, and submit them for official ranking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Advanced Skinning System:</strong> Completely customize your gameplay experience with the ability to create skins. Export and share your skins with friends or upload them to the Steam workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Replay System:</strong> Go back in time by watching your previous scores. Watch replays from other players around the world, or export your own and share them with your rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Become a master of Quaver by completing challenges and earning achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>100% Community-Driven:</strong> See your ideas come to life in-game by submitting feature requests and suggestions!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8dd4a923f96e7098c031e10275e29c3d008fd7e2.jpg","localized_name":"Baby Steps","name":"Baby Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/980610/8dd4a923f96e7098c031e10275e29c3d008fd7e2.jpg"},{"icon":"0ac295b040082bf03e3cd3e46da0289aa9963bcf.jpg","localized_name":"Absolutely Marvelous","name":"Absolutely Marvelous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/980610/0ac295b040082bf03e3cd3e46da0289aa9963bcf.jpg"},{"icon":"cc7b28969947945a8775de834106ed509af52dd7.jpg","localized_name":"Combolicious","name":"Combolicious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/980610/cc7b28969947945a8775de834106ed509af52dd7.jpg"},{"icon":"6088dfbc122b41ba26b2395742684a8ccb2871aa.jpg","localized_name":"Perfectionist","name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/980610/6088dfbc122b41ba26b2395742684a8ccb2871aa.jpg"},{"icon":"693794ce6f1313f6e159dc471aaa5dd903ed5885.jpg","localized_name":"Kept You Playing, Huh?","name":"Kept You Playing, Huh?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/980610/693794ce6f1313f6e159dc471aaa5dd903ed5885.jpg"},{"icon":"8e8ea57d2a34fb9c3718e49645751ea7c548cab0.jpg","localized_name":"Humble Beginnings","name":"Humble Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu